    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the following new ways to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Brand (Cost: 3d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or lose the ability to cast spells and turn Invisible until the end of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Castigate (Cost: 1d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or subtract 1d6 from its next Saving Throw before the end of your next turn.</li></ul>",
